1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,878
Kenapa motong bawang

2
00:00:00,878 --> 00:00:01,913
bikin nangis?

3
00:00:01,913 --> 00:00:03,190
A, pedas?

4
00:00:03,190 --> 00:00:04,797
B, ada gas?

5
00:00:04,797 --> 00:00:06,601
C, cuma sugesti?

6
00:00:07,771 --> 00:00:09,030
Jawabannya...

7
00:00:09,030 --> 00:00:10,709
B, GAS!

8
00:00:10,709 --> 00:00:11,256
Bawang punya

9
00:00:11,256 --> 00:00:12,719
senjata kimia!

10
00:00:12,719 --> 00:00:15,178
Dan ada bawang yang nggak bikin nangis...

11
00:00:15,178 --> 00:00:16,257
di akhir video.

12
00:00:16,257 --> 00:00:16,971
Begini prosesnya:

13
00:00:16,971 --> 00:00:19,209
saat dipotong, sel bawang pecah.

14
00:00:19,209 --> 00:00:22,325
Enzimnya mengubah zat belerang...

15
00:00:22,325 --> 00:00:24,075
jadi gas pemicu air mata.

16
00:00:24,075 --> 00:00:25,843
Gas itu sampai ke mata,

17
00:00:25,843 --> 00:00:26,771
dan air mata keluar

18
00:00:26,771 --> 00:00:28,007
untuk membilasnya!

19
00:00:28,007 --> 00:00:29,293
Mau nggak nangis?

20
00:00:29,293 --> 00:00:30,784
Dinginkan dulu di kulkas,

21
00:00:30,784 --> 00:00:31,971
pakai pisau yang tajam,

22
00:00:31,971 --> 00:00:34,187
dan potong akarnya paling akhir.

23
00:00:34,427 --> 00:00:35,484
Dan kejutannya:

24
00:00:35,484 --> 00:00:36,984
enzim pelakunya ditemukan

25
00:00:36,984 --> 00:00:38,912
ilmuwan Jepang tahun dua ribu dua.

26
00:00:38,912 --> 00:00:41,053
Sekarang sudah ada bawang hasil pemuliaan

27
00:00:41,053 --> 00:00:42,368
yang nggak bikin nangis,

28
00:00:42,368 --> 00:00:44,354
dijual di Amerika dan Inggris!

29
00:00:44,354 --> 00:00:45,666
Bawang memang kecil,

30
00:00:45,666 --> 00:00:47,220
tapi senjatanya kimia!

31
00:00:47,220 --> 00:00:47,959
Kirim ke temanmu

32
00:00:47,959 --> 00:00:50,751
yang selalu nangis di dapur!

